From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:03:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Herriott in the wave model; smooth averaging options in Fig.
 3

scripts/t14_herriott.js: Herriott cells 5-20 mm x 1.5 mm with the Task 14
grating-coupler input (launched from the M1 wall, clip loss in T), dithers and
membrane modulation, chaos check, 30 layouts, 3.3 and 1.53 um, R 97 / 99.5 %.
Fig. 2 (f) newest view shows R/C-Herriott and R/C-CMPC again. Fig. 3: the
newest curves are recomputed in the page for period-locked (default, smooth,
leakage 1e-3), boxcar or ideal whole-period averaging. REPORT 6i (8, 9).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLfEqncaEw1RGMDLUGdFgb
